# Debian/Ubuntu packages the vm unit builds with, beyond git, curl, python3,
# make and Node (CI installs them for this unit's job; light/setup.sh for a
# local build). clang-18, lld, llvm-strip and clang-tidy-18 build the
# kernels, init and strace; flex, bison, bc and libelf (objtool) the x86-64
# kernel; cpio the initramfs; autoconf, automake, libtool, libltdl-dev
# (LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE, which is in ltdl.m4), pkg-config and python3-venv
# (meson) QEMU's dependencies; jq the build's manifests.
clang
clang-18
clang-tidy-18
lld
llvm
flex
bison
bc
cpio
autoconf
automake
libtool
libltdl-dev
pkg-config
jq
libelf-dev
python3-venv
